            "title": "Example: Braces",
            "id": 74527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Segna il codice che appartiene a queste funzioni.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code> e poi <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa le definizioni delle funzioni in modo che la chiamata fornita visualizzi <code>Brightness up</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>increaseBrightness</code>, seguito da <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function",
            "id": 74492,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché creiamo le funzioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Raggruppare e riutilizzare codice correlato</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per separare il codice correlato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per facilitare la creazione delle variabili</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Raggruppare e riutilizzare codice correlato.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tre pulsanti devono mostrare lo stesso messaggio di conferma. Qual è il motivo migliore per inserire quel messaggio in una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il codice può essere raggruppato una volta e chiamato quando serve.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Definire la funzione fa apparire automaticamente il messaggio.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ogni pulsante riceve una copia distinta del codice del messaggio.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il codice può essere raggruppato una volta e chiamato quando serve.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 74488,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando chiamiamo una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il codice all'interno della funzione viene eseguito</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tutto il codice all'interno della funzione è memorizzato in una variabile</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">All'interno della funzione viene creato un ciclo while</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il codice all'interno della funzione viene eseguito.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>showMenu</code> contiene tre istruzioni <code>console.log</code>. Cosa succede quando il programma esegue <code>showMenu()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le tre istruzioni vengono eseguite in quel punto del programma.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le istruzioni vengono memorizzate in una nuova variabile.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">JavaScript crea un ciclo attorno alle istruzioni.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le tre istruzioni vengono eseguite in quel punto del programma.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 74483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la chiamata alla funzione scrivendo il suo nome.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayCash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot; Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(money + currency);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayCash();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"118\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>displayCash</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces",
            "id": 74532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code> su una riga e <code>Days a year</code> su quella successiva</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>365</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code> su una riga e <code>Days a year</code> su quella successiva.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando <code>daysAYear()</code> viene eseguita prima del log successivo, quale valore raggiunge per primo la console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code>, perché <code>daysAYear()</code> viene eseguita prima del log successivo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code>, perché si trova all'esterno della funzione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambi i valori compaiono sulla stessa riga.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code>, perché <code>daysAYear()</code> viene eseguita prima del log successivo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il parametro in questa funzione?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è alcun parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se il programma chiama <code>addUser(\"Mina\")</code>, quale nome riceve <code>\"Mina\"</code> all'interno della funzione copiata?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nessun nome la riceve, perché la funzione non ha parametri.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74578,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione e passale un valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>removeUser</code>, seguito da <code>\"Lisa\"</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa <code>removeUser</code>, quindi chiamala con <code>\"Lisa\"</code> in modo che la console segnali la sua rimozione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user</code>, seguito da <code>removeUser</code>, <code>\"Lisa\"</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono i parametri?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I parametri ci aiutano a passare informazioni specifiche alle funzioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I parametri rendono più facile chiamare le funzioni</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I parametri ci permettono di visualizzare le variabili nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I parametri ci aiutano a passare informazioni specifiche alle funzioni.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione <code>greet</code> deve visualizzare un nome diverso a ogni chiamata. Cosa deve usare per quel nome variabile?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un parametro come name.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa di nome fissa nella funzione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La stessa stringa di nome in ogni chiamata di funzione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un parametro come name.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un parametro alla funzione e poi chiamala con un valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temp</code>, seguito da <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la funzione e passale il numero <code>60</code>, così visualizza <code>Current temp:</code> seguito da quel numero.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;60&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temperatureUpdate</code>, seguito da <code>temp</code> e infine <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing a value ",
            "id": 74648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la chiamata alla funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"totalWeight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" measurement = \" /><text value=\"&quot; grams&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + measurement);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"totalWeight(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"111\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"250 grams\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>totalWeight</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Using the return value",
            "id": 74685,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando aggiungiamo un valore restituito a una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La funzione restituisce un valore al codice che la chiama</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La funzione non può più utilizzare istruzioni display</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Significa che potremo chiamare la funzione una sola volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La funzione restituisce un valore al codice che la chiama.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const total = addTen(20)</code> chiama una funzione che restituisce <code>30</code>. Cosa viene memorizzato in <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La funzione stessa.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>30</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No return statement",
            "id": 74687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come finiamo per restituire <code>undefined</code> dalla nostra funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dimenticando di aggiungere l'istruzione <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non includendo alcuna istruzione di visualizzazione nel nostro codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Chiamando la funzione con un parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dimenticando di aggiungere l'istruzione <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const answer = showAnswer()</code> chiama una funzione che visualizza solo testo e non contiene <code>return</code>. Cosa viene memorizzato in <code>answer</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il testo visualizzato.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il nome della funzione come stringa.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 74698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>result</code> e memorizza al suo interno il risultato della chiamata alla funzione con un valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"moreThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = moreThanTen(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>result</code> e poi <code>moreThanTen</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>",
